  "text": "Repository: netzkontrast/the-agency-system\nBranch convention: default is `Master` (capital M), not `main`. PRs target Master. Passing `base: main` to create_pull_request returns 422.\n\nPlugin stack:\n- bitwize-music 0.91.0 — 54 skills, 80+ MCP tools, Python venv at ~/.bitwize-music/venv/bin/python3\n- private-journal — npx github:obra/private-journal-mcp, stores in .private-journal/ (project) and ~/.private-journal/ (user)\n- Google Drive MCP — UUID 02fbb94b-1aaa-4e09-bcd2-e5748743f593, 8 tools for Drive file ops\n- GitHub MCP — scoped to netzkontrast/the-agency-system\n\nagents.md created at repo root (PR #22) — covers all four plugins with tool tables and agent dispatch rules. Added mandatory journal-at-session-end rule.\n\nKey CLAUDE.md rules to remember:\n1. Skills before MCP — always invoke the skill, let it call MCP\n2. Tools always win over hand-editing — use update_track_field, never Edit on track files\n3. rebuild_state before update_track_field on freshly created tracks\n4. Overrides are cross-project only — album-specific content lives in album folder\n5. Subagents by default for independent/parallel/context-heavy work",
